{"seq":97,"slug":"realtime-rendering-pipeline","title":"实时渲染管线","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline","rating":{"composite":3.84,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 实时渲染管线\n\n实时渲染管线是将三维场景数据在每帧 16ms 以内转化为屏幕像素的完整处理链路。它贯穿从顶点提交到最终像素输出的全过程，是现代游戏引擎图形系统的核心骨架。\n\n本 hub 聚焦于管线自身的架构、调度与执行机制，而非单一着色技术的编写细节。与兄弟 hub 的分工边界如下：shader-programming 关注着色器语言语法与单 pass 算法实现；game-graphics 覆盖美术向的视觉效果与材质表现；game-water-rendering 和 game-vegetation-rendering 是特定领域的专题渲染方案。本 hub 则站在引擎工程师视角，解释数据如何在管线各阶段流动、各阶段如何协同、以及现代硬件如何驱动管线架构的演进。\n\n前置知识要求：熟悉线性代数基础（矩阵变换、齐次坐标）、了解至少一种图形 API（OpenGL/Vulkan/DirectX）的基本概念、具备 C++ 或类似语言的系统编程经验。\n\n推荐学习路径：先从第一章管线架构建立全局认知，理解 GPU 硬件如何组织渲染流水线；第二章深入主流渲染技术的实现策略与权衡；第三章掌握性能优化的关键手段；最后第四章了解 2024-2026 年间管线架构的前沿演进方向——包括 Compute Shader 管线化、混合光追与 Render Graph 调度框架。\n\n四章内容由浅入深，每章内的三篇文档相互补充但各自独立可读。建议按章节顺序推进，遇到特定性能问题时可直接跳转第三章对应文档。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pipeline-architecture","title":"管线架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gpu-pipeline-overview","title":"GPU 图形管线全景概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/gpu-pipeline-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vertex-geometry-processing","title":"顶点与几何处理阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/vertex-geometry-processing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rasterization-fragment","title":"光栅化与片段处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/rasterization-fragment"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"rendering-techniques","title":"渲染技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/rendering-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forward-vs-deferred","title":"前向渲染与延迟渲染对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/rendering-techniques/forward-vs-deferred"},{"seq":2,"slug":"physically-based-rendering","title":"基于物理的渲染（PBR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/rendering-techniques/physically-based-rendering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-illumination-realtime","title":"实时全局光照方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/rendering-techniques/global-illumination-realtime"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization","title":"性能优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culling-batching","title":"剔除与批处理策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/optimization/culling-batching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lod-streaming","title":"LOD 与资源流送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/optimization/lod-streaming"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gpu-driven-rendering","title":"GPU 驱动渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/optimization/gpu-driven-rendering"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"modern-pipeline","title":"现代管线","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/modern-pipeline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compute-shader-pipeline","title":"Compute Shader 管线化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/modern-pipeline/compute-shader-pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ray-tracing-hybrid","title":"混合光线追踪管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/modern-pipeline/ray-tracing-hybrid"},{"seq":3,"slug":"frame-graph-render-graph","title":"Frame Graph 与 Render Graph 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/modern-pipeline/frame-graph-render-graph"}]}]}